step Silverpine Forest: kill these as you meet them
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip South down the road past Pyrewood: Dalaran Watchers and Wizards patrol the roads around Ambermill, and south-west of the town the Ravenclaw Drudgers and Guardians haunt the ruins of Beren's Peril in the south-east of the forest. Careful: High Order Mages (30) walk the same roads among the Watchers and Wizards: leave them.
  kill 1974 quest 516.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  kill 1973 quest 516.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Below ground

